  "specific_issues": [
    "Shoulders are turned with a guarded presentation. Actual shoulder owner and orientation reference are absent; guarded does not prove fear, hostility or a particular private intention. Actual carrier/shoulder ownership/connected region and reference basis unresolved. Reference may be a coordinate frame rather than entity; no typed reference P is authored until the actual reference class is chosen.",
    "Screen-face focus is named, with robot-concept proof or scene-anchor use in current embedding. Actual screen/face carrier, optical focus meaning and functional branch are unresolved; old depicted-face correction is not inherited. Actual screen-face class/representation owner, optical versus attentional focus, exact plane and concept-proof/scene-anchor function need explicit source choice. Actual RID refinement required; placeholder functional OR cannot be signed.",
    "A mirror frame presents a doubled self. One ordinary self/reflection interpretation is proposed without adding a second physical actor or assuming psychological identity split; actual appearance inventory and correspondence remain unresolved. Root must choose ordinary mirror versus another double-self interpretation and actual image/self/representation inventory. Generic P does not establish source/representation correspondence, mirror relation or count permission.",
    "A human gaze locks onto the viewer through glass. Gaze target, locked engagement and glass medium are explicit; actual gaze-bearing eyes, viewer scope and through-surface relation remain to be grounded. Actual actor/available eyes ownership, viewer-target scope and surface/path need root mapping. Source glass may be existing material prerequisite or selected material under different applications; current proposal chooses selected material but is not root selected.",
    "Adult glamour-influencer styling is selected for an independently declared adult human under this proposed application. Styling does not establish a real influencer, body proportions, profession or sexual context. Root must choose declared-adult application and exact existing actual actor/witnesses. No adult_allowed flag or metadata substitutes. This proposed guard strengthening and age-mode reading are not automatically approved."
